<title>ITALY: Gross yields fall at Italian BTP bond auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yields fall at Italian BTP bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a seventh tranche of 1.5 trillion lire worth of three-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (BTPs) with a 6.00 percent coupon, and a fifth tranche of 1.5 trillion lire of 6.25 percent May 15, 2002 BTPs.</p>
<p>		  May 15, 2000   pvs	May 15, 2002   pvs</p>
<p> Net Yield	 5.12 pct    5.37	  5.27 pct    5.51</p>
<p> Gross Yield     5.90 pct    6.16	  6.12 pct    6.37</p>
<p> Assigned price 100.45	99.80	 100.90	99.90</p>
<p> Bids	     3.867 trln lire	   2.824 trln lire</p>
<p> Assigned	 1.500 trln lire	   1.500 trln lire</p>
<p>Note - Results compare with a previous auction on June 17.</p>
</text>
